window.EN={"1":"The Lycian army, having welcomed Elffin as a strategist, followed his advice and headed for Caledonia, the island to the south.","2":"Caledonia is the island where Roy and the others are now, along with Fibernia,","3":"and Dia Island to its east — together the three are known as the Western Isles.","4":"And in the middle of long, narrow Caledonia stands Idina Castle.","5":"Here, the castellan Morgan has been rounding up men from across Caledonia and marching them off to the so-called \"Mine of Death,\"","6":"Ebraucum.","7":"By the time Roy and the others reached Idina, events had already begun to move...","8":"(citizen): Hey, hurry up! / This way!","9":"(citizen): I—is this really okay... / us running off like this...","10":"(citizen): You idiot!! If we'd been sent to the mine like that, / we'd have been worked to death!","11":"(citizen): Hey, kid, is that really fine with you? / You've got family waiting at home, don't you?","12":"(citizen): Ah... yeah...","13":"(citizen): If we run to the northeast, / there are people who'll help us, so they say.","14":"(citizen): No matter what, we'll make it there!","15":"(Arcardo): What did you say / The citizens have run off again!?","16":"(Arcardo): Grr, what were the garrison troops / doing!?","17":"(William Roberts): Th—that's... / someone slipped them a sleeping drug...","18":"(Arcardo): What!? Then that means / there's someone in league with the enemy.","19":"(Arcardo): Morgan!","20":"(Arcardo): You go after those who fled!","21":"(Morgan): Yes, sir.","22":"(Arcardo): I'm returning / to the governor's office in Jutor.","23":"(Arcardo): Understood? Gather as many hands as you can, even one at a time, / and send them to the northern mine!!","24":"(Roy): Elffin, / the castle visible to the southwest...","25":"(Elffin): Yes, that's Idina Castle. / The people rounded up on this island","26":"(Elffin): are gathered there once / before being sent off to the northern mine.","27":"(Elffin): Today, as it happens, is the day / the escort comes from the mine.","28":"(Elffin): Once they're taken to the Ebraucum mine, / rescuing them becomes very difficult.","29":"(Roy): Then we have to / rescue them right away!","30":"(Elffin): Yes. We've already slipped a few people in,","31":"(Elffin): and they're working to get the people / to escape from the castle.","32":"(Roy): What's the plan for their escape?","33":"(Elffin): They should be instructed to flee toward / the castle's northeast — in other words, this way.","34":"(Roy): Then first, let's help those people, / and after that head for the castle!","35":"(citizen): Mr. Geese, / are you really going?","36":"(Geese): Yeah. My men's killers / are in that castle.","37":"(Geese): I can't just leave it be.","38":"(citizen): The folks who / were always with you?","39":"(Geese): Yeah. While I was away, / on some job from the Etruria governor's office,","40":"(Geese): they were taken off and worked half to death at the mine, / and in the end, all of them...","41":"(citizen): ......","42":"(Geese): They were a bunch of fools, / but every one of them was a good guy.","43":"(Geese): And after all that...!!","44":"(citizen): So / you're going to avenge them all alone, Mr. Geese?","45":"(Geese): Something wrong with that?","46":"(citizen): No, it's not that, but... / are you really not going back to the shipping business?","47":"(Geese): Well...","48":"(Geese): Once I've avenged them, / if the fighting dies down, I'll think about it.","49":"(citizen): I see... we won't forget it, you know.","50":"(citizen): That even braving the dangers of the sea, / you all carried and sold all sorts of things for us.","51":"(citizen): If anything happens, / you can always count on us.","52":"(Geese): If I'm still alive, sure. / Thanks, ma'am.","53":"(Bartre): So the people of this island / are being held in that Idina Castle, huh.","54":"(citizen): Yes.","55":"(Bartre): Right, let's go / help them right away.","56":"(citizen): ...I'm sorry.","57":"(citizen): for having you help me / while I was looking for my daughter.","58":"(Bartre): You folks have done / a lot for us.","59":"(Bartre): Besides, if you're fighting / to protect the people of this island,","60":"(Bartre): a man would lose his honor / if he just abandoned you.","61":"(soldier): Lord Morgan, / reinforcements are ready!","62":"(Morgan): Good, send them in right away.","63":"(Morgan): Through the back door, / so it's fine even if the castle gets surrounded.","64":"(Geese): Hm? / What, you want something from me?","65":"(Roy): No, it's just... you're fighting the castle's / troops alone, and it caught my attention.","66":"(Geese): Who are you?","67":"(Roy): I'm Roy. / I lead the Lycian Alliance Army.","68":"(Roy): We came here at Etruria's request.","69":"(Geese): So you're Etruria's lackey! / Then you're the enemy — get ready!!","70":"(Roy): W—wait, please wait!","71":"(Roy): We're fighting the castle's soldiers too.","72":"(Geese): ? What do you mean?","73":"(Roy): Honestly, / we don't understand the reason either.","74":"(Roy): We're just acting on orders / to put down the \"brigands\"...","75":"(Geese): ...You said you / were fighting the castle folks.","76":"(Geese): Then how about hiring me?","77":"(Roy): Huh?","78":"(Geese): I'm a pirate, / so I know this area pretty well.","79":"(Geese): Looks like you folks / just got to this island.","80":"(Geese): Don't you need someone to guide you?","81":"(Roy): That would be reassuring, but / why the sudden offer?","82":"(Geese): I want to help wipe out the \"brigands.\"","83":"(Geese): Well, truth is / I'm probably lumped in as one too, being a pirate,","84":"(Geese): but I basically / only target the rich.","85":"(Roy): In that case, / please, we'd appreciate it.","86":"(Roy): This land is unfamiliar to us, / so we've been having a hard time.","87":"(Geese): Yeah, / leave it to me.","88":"(Geese): ...Just you wait, brothers of the sea, / I'll avenge you without fail!","89":"(Geese): What happens after that / is up to this Roy fellow, I guess.","90":"(Bartre): You lot / are men of the Kingdom of Etruria?","91":"(Roy): Y—yes, we are, but...","92":"(Bartre): We fight to save / the people of this island from their suffering!","93":"(Bartre): You evil lackeys / had better be ready!","94":"(Roy): H—hold on, / please wait a moment!","95":"(Roy): I'm not / your enemy!","96":"(Bartre): What!? Then aren't you / the castle's reinforcements?","97":"(Roy): Quite the opposite.","98":"(Roy): We're fighting here / to break through the castle gate.","99":"(Bartre): Is that so... / sorry! It seems I misjudged you.","100":"(Roy): I'm Roy, / I lead the Lycian Alliance Army.","101":"(Bartre): Lycia? That's / quite a long way off...","102":"(Roy): Our army was dispatched to Etruria / to put down the \"brigands\" that have holed up","103":"(Roy): on the islands of the west.","104":"(Bartre): Hm! So you really are with Etruria!?","105":"(Roy): Please calm down! / Our goal is the same as yours.","106":"(Roy): We want to help / so the people of this island can live in peace — that's all.","107":"(Bartre): ...You might end up / fighting the Kingdom of Etruria that sent you, you know?","108":"(Roy): ...Our duty is to find / and deal with those doing evil.","109":"(Roy): Even if that person / holds high rank, / I have no intention of backing down.","110":"(Bartre): Hmph! That's quite the resolve! / Very well, I'll fight alongside you too!!","111":"(Roy): You'll come with us? / That's reassuring — thank you!","112":"(Fir): Fa—Father!? / Why are you here?","113":"(Bartre): Oh, Fir, / I've been looking for you.","114":"(Fir): ...Father, / my resolve hasn't changed.","115":"(Fir): I too, like Mother, / want to travel the world and become a strong swordsman...","116":"(Bartre): I know.","117":"(Bartre): I haven't come / to take you back.","118":"(Bartre): Quite the opposite — I thought / I'd come help you out.","119":"(Fir): Help... me?","120":"(Bartre): Right. Even if it's sword training, / you're on an unfamiliar journey the whole time.","121":"(Bartre): There must be / all kinds of needless troubles too.","122":"(Bartre): So I thought / I'd help with that, you see...","123":"(Fir): But, / Father, that would defeat the purpose of training...","124":"(Bartre): What are you saying!","125":"(Bartre): Could having your father nearby / possibly get in the way of sword training?","126":"(Bartre): Or is it that you don't understand / this father's love, worrying about you?","127":"(Fir): N—no, / that's not it at all.","128":"(Bartre): Good, now that that's settled, / this is simple.","129":"(Bartre): First, / let's take this castle!","130":"(Fir): Haah...","131":"(Fir): I'd better report to Lord Roy / that our numbers have grown by one...","132":"(Fir): Fa—Father!? / Why are you here?","133":"(Bartre): Oh, Fir, / I've been looking for you.","134":"(Fir): ...Father, / my resolve hasn't changed.","135":"(Fir): I too, like Mother, / want to travel the world and become a strong swordsman...","136":"(Bartre): I know.","137":"(Bartre): I haven't come / to take you back.","138":"(Bartre): Quite the opposite — I thought / I'd come help you out.","139":"(Fir): Help... me?","140":"(Bartre): Right. Even if it's sword training, / you're on an unfamiliar journey the whole time.","141":"(Bartre): There must be / all kinds of needless troubles too.","142":"(Bartre): So I thought / I'd help with that, you see...","143":"(Fir): But, / Father, that would defeat the purpose of training...","144":"(Bartre): What are you saying!","145":"(Bartre): Could having your father nearby / possibly get in the way of sword training?","146":"(Bartre): Or is it that you don't understand / this father's love, worrying about you?","147":"(Fir): N—no, / that's not it at all.","148":"(Bartre): Good, now that that's settled, / this is simple.","149":"(Bartre): First, / let's take this castle!","150":"(child): Are you the people / who've come to help us?","151":"(child): Then here, take this. / I grabbed it from the castle while escaping.","152":"(child): I wonder if everyone else / got away safely...","153":"What are you doing!? / Hurry and dispose of the escapees...","154":"Wh—who are you people!?","155":"This land's resistance / should have been wiped out...","156":"Just who in the world are you...","157":"(Roy): Well, we've taken Idina Castle for now, but / liberating just this place","158":"(Roy): won't be enough to help the people of this island — no, / the whole of the Western Isles.","159":"(Elffin): That's right. / To do that, we'll have to strike at the root cause itself...","160":"(Elffin): We'll have to deal / with the governor's office that Etruria has installed.","161":"(Roy): I see, then Jutor is next.","162":"(Roy): ...By the way, Elffin, / may I ask you something?","163":"(Elffin): What is it?","164":"(Roy): I might be wrong,","165":"(Roy): but aren't you / a noble of very high standing in Etruria?","166":"(Elffin): !!","167":"(Elffin): Why... would you think that?","168":"(Roy): Hmm, I can't quite put it into words, / but maybe it's your way of speaking, things like that?","169":"(Roy): I think I've learned / to \"see\" people","170":"(Roy): a little, from my time in Ostia. / Am I right?","171":"(Elffin): If... that were true, / what would you do?","172":"(Roy): No, nothing in particular.","173":"(Elffin): ?","174":"(Roy): I imagine / there's some special reason for it.","175":"(Roy): Whenever you feel like talking about it, Elffin, / it'll be enough for me to just hear it then.","176":"(Elffin): ......","177":"(Roy): Now, let's go! / To the Etrurian governor's office in Jutor!","178":"(Roy): To help the people of the west! / To fight our true enemy!!","179":"If every single citizen has survived:","180":"(citizen): Hey, old man with the beard!","181":"(Marinus): Wh—what is it!! / You lot are...!?","182":"(citizen): Give this / to General Roy for us.","183":"(citizen): That we get to see our families again / is all thanks to that man.","184":"(citizen): The people of the west / never forget a debt we owe!","185":"(citizen): Be sure to / tell him our thanks.","186":"(citizen): That every one of us / is grateful from the bottom of our hearts!"};
